  {"issue": "The fee list defines a \"Management Fee\" in 5.4(a), but 6.2(c) forbids paying salaries in any month in which a \"Portfolio Management Fee\" is payable, a term defined nowhere. The mismatch of labels affects when 6.2(c) bites.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.26}
