  {"issue": "Permitted commissions are those \"customarily provided for such services to third parties in connection with like kind transactions in the geographic area\", a standard with no fixed content. Its application would turn on evidence rather than text.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.27},
  {"issue": "By disapplying clauses (i)-(iii) to sales to Sponsored Investment Funds and Private Clients, this sub-clause removes the marketing, best-price and no-commission protections from the very affiliated buyers 5.7(b) was drafted to police. The exception is hard to reconcile with the restriction it qualifies.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.38}
]},
{"clause_id": "c060", "issues": [
  {"issue": "The condition reads \"the borrower shall not be default under the loan\", omitting \"in\"; the sense is recoverable but the sentence is ungrammatical. It also leaves unstated whether non-monetary defaults count.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.22},
  {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.11}
