]},
{"clause_id": "c064", "issues": [
  {"issue": "\"Related Party Loan\" is triggered only where \"the borrower is an Affiliate\", and \"Affiliate\" in 5.1(a) expressly excludes Noteholders and non-voting members of Sponsored Investment Funds. The gateway definition therefore controls the whole of 5.7(e) and its boundary is arguable.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.36},
