  {"issue": "The exclusion removes from \"Related Party Loan\" any loan whose borrower is a Sponsored Investment Fund or Private Client, categories defined in 5.1(b)-(c) to include entities owned or managed by the Manager. Whether such a loan is nonetheless a loan to an \"Affiliate\" under 5.7(e) is precisely the kind of question a court is asked to resolve.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.52},
